host_about:
Hi we're Taras and Olga! 
- We are flexible, kind, peaceful;
- We like art, music and books;
- And travel :)
And we like our beautiful home in Toronto. 
Please come, relax, enjoy!

I'm gonna follow the airbnb describe yourself plan: 
- Favorite travel: Paris!
- Favorite movies: not possible to say, too many   
- Favorite food:  Not too much Spicy foods, Cheesybread and hummus

Superhost in Toronto
Among the things I love are: 
Books & newspapers;
Toronto and other great cities; 
Cycling; 
Mint Juleps and Manhattans 
Great bread;
Urban planning; 
Yoga; 
St. Lawrence Market; 
Grass-fed milk;
Skating at City Hall;
Toronto International Film Festival

I'm currently living in Toronto. Traveling internationally is my best passion been to over a dozen countries already. I would love to meet new friends and learn new things and I find something to enjoy about almost everyone from Terry Fox to Bill Gates and Conrad Black. 

Sharing my place with visitors with a fresh perspective is like travelling while being home. Interesting thinkers and active urban explorers who want to discover the delights of Toronto are my special favourites.

I enjoy welcoming visitors who are as considerate and respectful of my much-loved place.

While I can't claim to always  practice them,  I believe 'Only connect' and 'Love more' are the mantras that the world needs more of.
